WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.130
Another galaxy.

00:01.788 --> 00:03.783
Now far beyond our own galaxy.

00:04.177 --> 00:09.174
The Whirlpool is a spiral galaxy tens of millions of light-years away, seen face on.

00:09.661 --> 00:13.521
A smaller galaxy is passing behind it and tugging on one arm.

00:14.175 --> 00:18.921
The pink knots along the arms are clouds of hydrogen where new stars are forming.
